उपदेक्ष्यन्ति ते ज्ञानं ज्ञानिनस्तत्त्वदर्शिनः ॥ ३४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1499,\"bb\":1328,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/34/b1328/\",\"body_value\":\"tad viddhi praṇipātena
paripraśnena sevayā
